"┏ Reply ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓"
"┃To:   ┌Keys──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐      ┃"
"┃Cc:   │Tab / Shift-Tab          Next field / previous field                      │      ┃"
"┃Subjec│Enter  ↑ ↓               Move between From, To, Cc and Subject            │      ┃"
"┃──────│← →  in From             Change the account it is sent from               │──────┃"
"┃1     │a, b; c                  Separate several addresses                       │      ┃"
"┃      │i a I A o O              Type in the body, insert mode                    │      ┃"
"┃      │Esc                      Back to normal mode                              │      ┃"
"┃      │h j k l w b e 0 $ gg G   Move in the body                                 │      ┃"
"┃      │dd cw x p u Ctrl-R v V   Edit vim style                                   │      ┃"
"┃┌  Rep│Ctrl-A                   Attach a file (Tab to it, d takes it off)        │─────┐┃"
"┃│1   F│Ctrl-S                   Send                                             │     │┃"
"┃│  1 S│Esc in normal mode       Close, asking first if anything was written      │     │┃"
"┃└─────│Ctrl-C                   Quit                                             │─────┘┃"
"┗━━━━━━│                         Press any key to close                           │━━━━━━┛"
" NORMAL└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘       "
